# Line endings: keep text files as LF in the repo
* text=auto eol=lf
*.png  binary
*.jpg  binary
*.pdf  binary
*.xlsx binary
*.stl  binary
*.f3d  binary
*.step binary
# Git LFS is NOT used for now: every file is under 5 MB and the whole repo is ~25 MB.
# Switch to LFS only if the repo grows past ~500 MB (STL archives, many photos).
